{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id460407230"}, "name":{"label":"The#1AndyMan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-28T08:41:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.7"}, "id":{"label":"14358875275"}, "title":{"label":"Funny App, Bad Forecasts"}, "content":{"label":"Living in drought is hard enough. It’s even harder when the app keeps promising rain and there is none for months. It’s like psychological torture. Why pay for consistently incorrect information? The free apps have been more accurate of late. \n\nThe silver lining is that the app cracks some funny jokes. But I think Carrot should focus more on forecasts than trying to make its users laugh.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id32083493"}, "name":{"label":"Nitest4lker"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-25T18:26:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.7"}, "id":{"label":"14348505441"}, "title":{"label":"Non-Usable."}, "content":{"label":"Absolutely regret paying for the subscription. Completely inaccurate temperature readings. Off by anywhere from 5-10 degrees depending on location. \n\nIf I could get a refund I would.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
