{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id210703213"}, "name":{"label":"BlkWhiteFilmPix"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-22T08:43:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.7"}, "id":{"label":"14334858427"}, "title":{"label":"Watch complications frequently display wrong conditions"}, "content":{"label":"As I write this the Conditions (Other) displays a cloud icon with rain underneath. It’s not raining, and Weather radar depicts no rain within 100 miles. The complication frequently displays a lightning bolt even when - again - weather radar shows no thunderstorms. Finally, your “meatbags” references are quite worn out after all these years. Can’t you come up with some new material? You’re not funny", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id651655740"}, "name":{"label":"Sir Twill"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-22T07:32:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.7"}, "id":{"label":"14334604525"}, "title":{"label":"💯"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried just about every weather app out there, and CARROT is hands down the best. The forecasts are accurate, the radar is smooth, and I actually enjoy checking the weather now. The sarcastic personality gives me a good laugh, especially when it’s fixing to rain again for the third afternoon this week. It’s packed with features if you want all the details, but it’s still easy to use. Worth every penny—this is the only weather app I’ll keep on my phone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id42069291"}, "name":{"label":"Tim Pope"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-21T20:07:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.7"}, "id":{"label":"14332764469"}, "title":{"label":"⚠️"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a subscriber for a full decade at this point as I haven’t found anything better, but those 10 years have caused me to go full Joker mode over ⚠️ advisories. Please just let me turn off ⚠️advisories. There is almost always a ⚠️ advisory in effect, a rip torrent if nothing else, and I do not care. And I especially do not care when it’s showing a ⚠️ in my watch complication instead of the custom sunrise/sunset data point I configured. This is the killer feature that got me to pay and it’s been fundamentally unusable for several years now! Because hey, there’s a rip current. There’s a rip current today, just like there was a rip current yesterday, and just like there will be a rip current tomorrow.\n\ntl;dr Please please please just let me turn the ⚠️ off.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
